| Goal ID | Goal Title                 | Text                                                         | Runtime Annotation | Goal Type | Relation |
| ------- | -------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ | ------------------ | --------- | -------- |
| G1      | Handle Food Delivery Requests | Ensure all food delivery requests are processed correctly. | -                  | Perform   | -        |
| G2      | Deliver Meal               | Deliver the meal to the inpatient room using either direct placement or tray retrieval. | (G3; G4)           | Perform   | G1       |
| G3      | Place Meal Directly        | Use a special manipulation skill to place the meal on the room table. | -                  | Perform   | G2       |
| G4      | Have Someone Fetch Meal    | Determine if the inpatient or another entity can retrieve the meal from the robot's tray. | (G5; G6)           | Perform   | G2       |
| G5      | Indicate Meal to Retrieve  | Specify which meal corresponds to the inpatient and track retrieval. | -                  | Perform   | G4       |
| G6      | Alert on Wrong Retrieval   | Notify if an incorrect meal is retrieved by the inpatient or another entity. | -                  | Perform   | G4       |
| G7      | Retrieve Dishes            | Collect dirty dishes from the inpatient room using unassisted, cooperative, or human-assisted methods. | (G8; G9)           | Perform   | G1       |
| G8      | Open Room Door             | Open the room door using either robot cooperation or human assistance. | (G10; G11)         | Perform   | G7       |
| G9      | Track Dish Retrieval       | Monitor when and where each dish is retrieved to ensure proper handling. | -                  | Perform   | G7       |
| G10     | Determine Door Opener Availability | Check if a human or robot can open the door for dish retrieval. | FALLBACK(G12, G13) | Query     | G8       |
| G11     | Confirm Door Opening       | Verify that the door is successfully opened for dish retrieval. | -                  | Perform   | G8       |
| G12     | Check Human Availability   | Query if a human (nurse, companion) is present to open the door. | -                  | Query     | G10      |
| G13     | Check Robot Cooperation    | Query if another robot is available to assist with door opening. | -                  | Query     | G10      |

| Task ID | Task Title             | Text                                           | Relation | Location          | Number of Robots |
| ------- | ---------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- | -------- | ----------------- | ---------------- |
| AT1     | Use Manipulation Skill | Execute the special skill to place the meal on the table. | AND      | Inpatient Room    | 1                |
| AT2     | Indicate Meal to Retrieve | Display or communicate which meal corresponds to the inpatient. | AND      | Inpatient Room    | 1                |
| AT3     | Track Retrieval        | Log the time and location of each meal retrieval. | AND      | Inpatient Room    | 1                |
| AT4     | Alert on Wrong Meal    | Notify if an incorrect meal is retrieved by the inpatient. | AND      | Inpatient Room    | 1                |
| AT5     | Retrieve Dirty Dishes  | Collect and transport dirty dishes from the room. | AND      | Inpatient Room    | [1,2]            |
| AT6     | Open Room Door         | Physically open the room door for dish retrieval. | AND      | Inpatient Room    | [1,2]            |
| AT7     | Confirm Door Opened    | Verify that the door is fully opened and accessible. | AND      | Inpatient Room    | 1                |

**Logical Relationships:**

- **G1 -> G2, G7 [AND]** (Both delivering meals and retrieving dishes are required for each delivery request)
- **G2 -> G3, G4 [OR]** (Either direct placement or tray retrieval is sufficient for meal delivery)
- **G4 -> G5, G6 [AND]** (Indicating the meal and alerting on errors are both required for tray retrieval)
- **G7 -> G8, G9 [AND]** (Opening the door and tracking dish retrieval are both required for dish collection)
- **G8 -> G10, G11 [OR]** (Either human or robot assistance is sufficient for door opening)
- **G10 -> G12, G13 [FALLBACK(G12, G13)]** (Fallback to robot cooperation if no human is available)
- **G2 -> AT1, AT2, AT3, AT4 [AND]** (All tasks are required for tray retrieval and direct placement)
- **G7 -> AT5, AT6, AT7 [AND]** (All tasks are required for dish retrieval)
